<title>JAPAN: Key 182nd JGB yield surges more than 10 basis pts.</title>
<headline>Key 182nd JGB yield surges more than 10 basis pts.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The key 182nd 10-year Japanese government bond yield surged more than 10 basis points to 2.700 percent in early Tokyo trade on Friday.</p>
<p>The key bond yield closed at 2.590 percent on Thursday.</p>
</text>
